---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Fangcun Mood · Everyday Expression" description="A small object commissioned from your own words and everyday mood."><section class="container en-custom"><span class="eyebrow">Fangcun Mood</span><h1 class="serif">Your line,<br />your everyday mood.</h1><p>Choose a phrase, a carrier and a script preference. We will discuss the right form and timeline with you before any commitment.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/custom/">Open the Fangcun Mood brief →</a></section></Layout>
<style>.en-custom{padding:120px 0;min-height:65vh}.en-custom h1{font-size:clamp(56px,8vw,100px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.1;margin:24px 0}.en-custom p{max-width:640px;color:var(--ink-soft);font:20px/1.8 Georgia,serif}@media(max-width:767px){.en-custom{padding:78px 0}.en-custom h1{font-size:56px}.en-custom p{font-size:18px}}
</style>
